* provenance: generic small-signal N and P channel JFETs, typical values only, no single datasheet; values are UNVERIFIED against a manufacturer sheet
* fit: N: Idss about 5 mA (Beta 1.25m, Vto -2 V), Lambda 2m; P: the same magnitudes (SpiceSharp takes Vto negative for both channel types); measured in SpiceSharp, not read from a sheet
* author: 4esv
* license: MIT

.model JN NJF(Beta=1.25m Vto=-2 Lambda=2m)
.model JP PJF(Beta=1.25m Vto=-2 Lambda=2m)
